    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、9:16竖屏的真人年代剧情特写段落，真人影像\" (Generate a 15-second, 9:16 vertical real person period drama close-up sequence).\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The visuals are generally strong with clear detail in the subject and setting.\n- Lighting is warm and consistent, contributing to a cohesive look.\n- The background bookshelves and period props are well-rendered, supporting the intended aesthetic.\n- There are occasional minor softness or slight color grading inconsistencies that prevent a perfect top-tier score.\n- Overall, visual quality is solid and professional, but not flawless.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The video largely aligns with the prompt: it presents a real person in period attire within a study/library setting, with visible props such as an envelope and paper, and a vintage lamp, all framed in a vertical orientation.\n- The sequence appears to focus on a close-up activity involving hands and documents, which matches the requested close-up emphasis.\n- The duration is consistent with a 15-second segment across the overall video.\n- Alignment is strong and coherent, though there may be minor pacing or framing choices that prevent a perfect match.\n\nPhysical Consistency / Common-sense:\n- Movements and interactions feel natural and plausible; hand gestures, object handling, and spatial relationships follow everyday physics.\n- The scene maintains logical continuity between actions, with no obvious contradictions.\n- A few micro-timing or micro-movement nuances could be refined, but they do not undermine overall plausibility.\n\nOverall assessment:\n- Visual Quality: 4/5\n- Text-to-Video Alignment: 4/5\n- Physical Consistency: 4/5\n\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
